WEBVTT

00:08:25.960 --> 00:08:30.506
our Love Punks community
and our Neonz community

00:08:30.506 --> 00:08:33.050
are totally ready for this future.

00:08:33.050 --> 00:08:35.052
But how are you folks feeling?

00:08:35.469 --> 00:08:37.513
(Cheers)

00:08:37.513 --> 00:08:40.474
Are you ready for this brave
new digital world?

00:08:40.516 --> 00:08:42.935
(Audience murmurs)

00:08:42.977 --> 00:08:44.520
Not sure?

00:08:44.520 --> 00:08:46.772
Well, this is just the beginning.

00:08:46.814 --> 00:08:49.567
You could leave a digital artwork
on the street corner

00:08:49.608 --> 00:08:51.360
for your lover to find.

00:08:51.402 --> 00:08:54.405
You could reinvent your backyard
with an animated treasure hunt

00:08:54.405 --> 00:08:57.116
for your kids and their friends.

00:08:57.116 --> 00:09:00.536
We could use this tool
to simply cover the world.